  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "writer 三前置与冻结",
      "items": [
        "① methods/Qx/qx_final_method_explanation.md ② results/Qx/reports/qx_final_result_analysis.md ③ results/Qx/reports/qx_solution_package_for_writer.md，每个数字 claim 源自现行 frozen_numbers.json",
        "冻结前需 package_signoff；改数=解冻→改源→重跑→重冻结+freeze_change_log.md；check_frozen_freshness 前置"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "G6 与 QA 层",
      "items": [
        "consistency-auditor → completeness-auditor → quality-assurance-auditor；三份工件齐才可最终装配，内容由人终判",
        "qa_report 状态词表：MECHANICAL_PASS/SEMANTIC_PASS/CONDITIONAL/HUMAN_JUDGMENT_PENDING/GATE_BLOCKED/NOT_RUN/CURRENT/STALE/MISSING"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "装配红线",
      "items": [
        "latex_assembly.py .（--dry-run / --check-only --strict / --template cumcmthesis）；模板：clean-room main.tex 或构建期外部 CUMCMThesis（固定 commit 38d1f21，不 vendor）",
        "裸数字扫描（冻结宏引用）；preflight 任一执行步骤失败即 exit 2"
      ]
    }
